{"resourceIdentifier":"4916","resourceName":"Guangxi Laibin Organic Wastewater Biogas Power Generation Comprehensive Utilization Project","description":"Guangxi Laibin Organic Wastewater Biogas Power Generation Comprehensive Utilization Project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located on the east side of the paper mill area of Guangxi Xinggui Paper Industry Co., Ltd. (hereafter referred to as Xinggui paper mill), Honghe Farm, Mengcun Town, Xingbin District, Laibin City, Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region, P. R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Guangxi Gangya Shengda New Energy Co., Ltd. \r\nThe project started to construct on 05/03/2023 and started operation on 29/06/2023.The project has a total designed capacity 2MW (3*1MW, one is for back-up use) and combusts the organic wastewater biogas, which contains nearly 74.93% of methane, to generate electricity for Xinggui paper mill to consume. The project collects and utilizes the biogas generated by the anaerobic treatment section of organic wastewater to generate electricity, which would otherwise be released into the atmosphere. Methane in the organic wastewater biogas has been emitted to the atmosphere since the sewage treatment station started operation. Therefore, the project avoids methane emissions and, at the same time, electricity is generated from a renewable energy source, instead of being provided by the grid. The project activity is expected to displace 14,400 MWh of electricity per year by reducing the import from the grid to the plant. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reduction of the project is 62,771 tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 627,710 tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.","location":{"latitude":23.715447,"longitude":109.415165},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-01-26","endExclusive":"2024-02-26","endInclusive":"2024-02-25"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4916"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"62771"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Energy industries (renewable/non-renewable sources)"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.F.,AMS-III.H."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"04/12/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 29/06/2023 - 28/06/2033"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=106364&IDKEY=ilksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku0989146675956","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_DRAFT_4916_10JAN2024.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-01-23T15:02:18.9Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=105668&IDKEY=ciofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3v145716172","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Laibin-Listing-Representation-Single-PP-v4.2.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-01-10T03:43:58.593Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https